<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Copyright>Copyright © 2013-$([System.DateTime]::Now.Year) Akka.NET Team</Copyright>
    <Authors>Akka.NET Team</Authors>
    <VersionPrefix>1.5.74</VersionPrefix>
    <PackageIconUrl>http://getakka.net/images/akkalogo.png</PackageIconUrl>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/akkadotnet/Alpakka</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <EnableNETAnalyzers>true</EnableNETAnalyzers>
    <WarningsAsErrors>$(WarningsAsErrors);nullable;CS4014</WarningsAsErrors>
    <NuGetAudit>true</NuGetAudit>
    <NuGetAuditMode>all</NuGetAuditMode>
    <NuGetAuditLevel>low</NuGetAuditLevel>
    <TargetIsMono Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == '$(NetFrameworkLibVersion)' and '$(OS)' == 'Unix'">true</TargetIsMono>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CS1591;xUnit1013</NoWarn>
    <AkkaPackageTags>akka;actors;actor model;Akka;concurrency;streams</AkkaPackageTags>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <NetStandardLibVersion>netstandard2.0</NetStandardLibVersion>
    <NetLibVersion>net6.0</NetLibVersion>
    <NetTestVersion>net10.0</NetTestVersion>
    <NetFrameworkTestVersion>net48</NetFrameworkTestVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <CopyLocalLockFileAssemblies>true</CopyLocalLockFileAssemblies>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>* Bump the minimum Akka.NET dependency to [1.5.74](https://github.com/akkadotnet/akka.net/releases/tag/1.5.74), with aligned Streams and TestKit dependencies.
* Include an individual README in each of the twelve connector packages, with usage, ownership, delivery semantics, limitations and linked NuGet version/download badges. Expand the repository README and documentation navigation.
* Update compatible Azure, AWS, AMQP and SignalR dependencies. Package READMEs document remaining SDK support and version limitations.
* Azure Service Bus JSON sources await successful message completion before emitting values and propagate settlement failures.
* Fix SQS batch-response correlation when response entries arrive in a different order.
* Improve SNS and Kinesis completion, cancellation and failure handling.
* Remove blocking SignalR send waits while preserving sequential delivery and existing materialized values.
* Propagate AMQP conversion and connection failures through the materialized completion task.
* Correct CSV parsing across split CRLF/escape sequences and XML parser empty-element/document completion, including reader and feeder cleanup.
* Improve rotating-file sink cleanup on completion and failures.
* Add required service integration, package/API, unchanged-consumer and packaged-example validation. Harden Event Hubs startup and Service Bus polling tests.
* Replace legacy FluentAssertions usages with xUnit assertions, retaining their payload, ordering, exception and deadline checks.
* Mark the historical `Akka.Streams.Channels`, `Akka.Streams.Azure.EventHub.V5` and `Akka.Streams.SignalR.AspNetCore` packages as Legacy on NuGet. See the [migration guide](https://alpakka.getakka.net/documentation/LegacyPackages.html) for their maintained replacements and compatibility requirements.

**Upstream compatibility:** Alpakka retains its public APIs and library targets. Raising the Akka.NET minimum from 1.5.60 inherits upstream binary changes: the old `RetrySupport.Retry` overload with an `int randomFactor` is replaced by a `double` overload, and `ISourceQueue&lt;T&gt;` requires `OfferAsync(T, CancellationToken)`. Applications using that old compiled overload or custom queue implementations need to update and rebuild against the new dependencies.</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <!-- SourceLink support for all Akka.NET projects -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub" PrivateAssets="All" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <!-- Optional: Embed source files that are not tracked by the source control manager in the PDB -->
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <!-- Optional: Build symbol package (.snupkg) to distribute the PDB containing Source Link -->
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>